{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "d7933a19e1e1b651eb85a363a3be7634b9a282fee773a1ce85e4500f118de98d", "ja": "『好き』は作れる", "zh": "“喜欢”是可以创造的", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "620bab695065399583306c5f542197ee6ca00bb88fc673334875a078efbd4322", "ja": "歌への共感を求め、特別レッスンが始まる。\n先生として呼ばれたのは……紗代子！\nまず、それぞれの好きなものを思い\n浮かべてみる事に。海美はバレエの\n表現から、曲の理解を深めるのだった。", "zh": "为了寻求对歌曲的共鸣，特别课程开始了。\n被请来担任老师的是……纱代子！\n首先，决定试着想想\n各自喜欢的事物。海美则从芭蕾的\n表现中加深了对歌曲的理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "67069ddde0b97ce5594d6eb838db6b8ef47db3fa52f2c46040b1ababeb5e73c3", "ja": "（天体公演のレッスンは順調に進んでいる。\n今日は海美の希望で、特別レッスンをする事になった）", "zh": "（天体公演的练习进展得很顺利。今天应海美的要求，决定进行特别练习。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "55f34f44bc2401ab80cbd1810a6a450de16ab786d9275fbbc7998be10007e3e7", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n特別レッスンって、一体何をするんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n特别训练到底要做些什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "f6fb2c9d3caba2a9af3f940624209de9a9c743581420e2bbae34b931127edddd", "ja": "それはやっぱり、せ、セクシーな……\nううっ、ありさの口からはこれ以上言えませんーっ！", "zh": "那当然是，色、色气的……\n呜呜，这种话我实在没法从嘴里说出来啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "14f200ae91f98952d3b673ca79c75fea9d5b23ede9fef201de9935b7f79a9703", "ja": "実は、俺も何をするか聞かされてないんだ。", "zh": "其实我也没听说要做什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "94ca6f611a2ec60a46d5f700318a4bb0ffd083e242dc0276058bdef732096c3c", "ja": "えっ、そうなんですか？　特別レッスンは、\n海美ちゃんが提案してくれたんですよね？", "zh": "咦，是这样吗？特别训练是海美提议的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1965d417eddb37f8fa750b850f6156fc63ad6860e73d0d51906e2b38145106dd", "ja": "ああ。なんでも、やってみたいことがあるらしい。\nけど、肝心の海美がまだ来てないからな……。", "zh": "嗯。听说她好像有件想尝试的事。\n不过，关键是海美还没来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1006_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "407cd669788d9197d9263deeef2ea3911f18825ebc9b595ab6df3238f7650fa0", "ja": "みんな、お待たせ！　連れてきたよ～！", "zh": "大家久等啦！我把人带来咯～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "9871b40f2c98b73cf635aacc0fedcbf6af2925501106f56ac81cd1b35d050ce5", "ja": "今日の特別レッスンを担当してくれる、\n高山紗代子先生でーす！", "zh": "今天的特别课程由\n高山纱代子老师负责——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "7bae077cc2c78bacedc5b6e6d930cc17ac8abd8ebe5e9d11009e32fe63ac2b93", "ja": "海美から話を聞いて、参加することになりました！\n私も手探りだけど、一緒に勉強させてください！", "zh": "听海美说了这件事后，我决定参加！\n我也还在摸索中，就让我们一起学习吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "a4027f4d7944a63bd7eef72a4d4f0b3320ea230d1da04679e18ac61f3a38742a", "ja": "うん。こちらこそよろしく、紗代子。\n……じゃなくて、紗代子先生！", "zh": "嗯。我才要请你多指教呢，纱代子。\n……不对，是纱代子老师！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "82e9dced6a193a6da704a6c0a7ceb4d16b9cbfe3580676032485200ffddd59b0", "ja": "も、もう。先生はやめてください、琴葉さん。\nいつもどおりでお願いします。", "zh": "真是的，琴叶，别叫我老师啦。\n还是和平常一样就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1012_p", "source_sha256": "55c2dbdda1d84610a64dcc88ce7a5dbc5374ce895496f54c6509a4c1d5fd2de9", "ja": "それで、特別レッスンって、\nどんなことをするつもりなんだ？", "zh": "那么，所谓的特别训练，你打算做些什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "7e90a5cb0e35dde2a6ab14090740378defb226ad0750b17a6ebd1f7ed66e6edf", "ja": "そのことなんですけど……{$P$}。\nすみませんが、退室してもらっていいですか？", "zh": "就是关于那件事……{$P$}。\n不好意思，可以请您先离开吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2f6015246c7896136ef1b82bc83f329d3175e7100fc704a499ca5bd5754ecc59", "ja": "えっ。", "zh": "咦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "4952d649e84fb44215fbd11e002f41a50fc897f504c84a0674a4578ea43d8066", "ja": "ワガママを言ってすみません！\nでも、その……見られていると、恥ずかしくて……。", "zh": "说出这么任性的话，真是对不起！\n可是，那个……被人盯着看的话，会很害羞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1016_p", "source_sha256": "463dd988ab03e61a023db55d3c6226abe782fd94fa32366d59af08631638c6a9", "ja": "（前回も、こんな事があったな……いや、\n紗代子にも考えがあるみたいだし、任せてみよう）", "zh": "（上次也发生过这种事啊……不，既然纱代子好像也有自己的想法，那就让她试试吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ed928aeafd7ebe372b9358ce4708a95cef2b0e97cd0684d894ad37824a0d6cd0", "ja": "そ、そうか……わかった。そういう事なら出ていくよ。\n事務室にいるから、何かあったら呼んでくれ。", "zh": "这、这样啊……我明白了。既然你都这么说，那我就出去吧。\n我会待在办公室，有什么事就叫我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1018_se", "source_sha256": "90d520655011510485f6d55f1da7d9fa0fb6c086509870309e75aa7305f1500b", "ja": "バタンッ", "zh": "砰", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "d7d6016d162419c91c3db7cc27d1380e33218745116d51ecafaa14ae1da12793", "ja": "{$P$}さんを追い出してまで……\nど、どんな恥ずかしいことをする気なんですか！？", "zh": "甚至不惜把{$P$}先生赶出去……\n到、到底打算做什么难为情的事啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "1c6b43e24973db5b7f4c67cca7d0773d3d9cabf7530eb321952a48db25f75ac7", "ja": "いえっ。これは考えようによっては、\nシャッターチャンスの予感……！", "zh": "不。换个角度想，\n这预示着绝佳的快门机会……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "b0b9a46ad34b2fe02d397d693b7173c96700f22f0e043da152db2ed9a350592c", "ja": "は、恥ずかしいことなんてしないよ！　ただ、恋の話を\nするなら、私たちだけの方がいいかなって……。", "zh": "才、才不会做什么羞人的事呢！只是，我觉得要聊恋爱的话，还是只有我们两个人比较好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1022_027say", "source_sha256": "b2634db9a9a461f986af358933192e730676b15a922d9a0b09bc81c51fdc452f", "ja": "私も、みんなの曲の歌詞を読ませてもらったけど。\nすごく、激しい感情を描いた曲だよね。", "zh": "我也拜读了大家歌曲的歌词。\n感觉这是一首描写强烈情感的歌曲呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1023_027say", "source_sha256": "76e0ff5db2284bbfee1e5c2e2acee96b318f687fbe2704f7d9cefd54eaa522ce", "ja": "その感情を、実際に体験するのは難しいけど……\nでも、共感することならできるかもしれない、って。", "zh": "虽然很难亲身体会那种感情……\n不过，或许可以试着去共情……我是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "55f08169d97ab9f1cb970a12d6f32869ba830272714da2c89b3031e78c6cc7c2", "ja": "共感する……どうやって？", "zh": "产生共鸣……要怎么做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1025_027say", "source_sha256": "650b179d4dc32719e8fbc890cc6d47bdea1a37234208ec0d170426fcf498a780", "ja": "そうだね、たとえば……亜利沙ちゃん。亜利沙ちゃんが\n大好きなことで、絶対にやめられないものって、何？", "zh": "是啊，比如说……亚利沙。亚利沙最喜欢、绝对戒不掉的东西是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "daa944afe21707718dea4e532463e46702d58498d5acdd6ff978ac1b759f64a8", "ja": "ありさが絶対にやめられないものですか？\nそれはもちろん、アイドルちゃんのファンですね！", "zh": "亚利沙绝对戒不掉的东西吗？\n那当然是，当偶像妹子们的粉丝啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1027_027say", "source_sha256": "b33fc29c86e953a332153743aca9642dd0342f82dbe55524fc96f646429d2c49", "ja": "それじゃ、もしライブに行っちゃダメ！って\n言われたら、どうする？", "zh": "那么，如果有人说“不许去看演唱会！”的话，你会怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "0d976c643a11042449d2fe2b7a66893b3bf38110942a87344af02017a9e94142", "ja": "えええええ！！？　それは無理、\nありさ、それだけは絶対に無理ですーっ！！", "zh": "诶诶诶诶诶！！？那可不行，只有这件事，亚利沙绝对做不到——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "5306ad4fe3086f2a779d266a3d738f91d0e3b0a7c2cb4ae249f1b4db84ce1fda", "ja": "ライブは一期一会！　その時、その場所でしか\n体験できない貴重なものなんですよ！？", "zh": "演出会是一生只有一次的邂逅！那一刻、那个地方才能体验到的珍贵事物哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1030_017kth", "source_sha256": "1b5cabc23f9d951ea4f889af72683ec0e553602f6bb84e4abb35bbf5f8f2e0ad", "ja": "あっ……そっか。そういうことか……。", "zh": "啊……原来如此。是这么回事啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1031_033sih", "source_sha256": "d45f4edd35a4e24b26074d87b3b293c0eb70c40bdd2be05d5e97bdb344bcf7aa", "ja": "え？　琴葉さん、今のでわかったんですか？", "zh": "咦？琴叶，你刚才那样就明白了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1032_017kth", "source_sha256": "152863dcfed370fcee0376821488ac208a23422cba2a999f505518c6d81b914a", "ja": "なんとなく。……この曲の歌詞って、\n好きな相手のことを、すごく求めているよね？", "zh": "大概能猜到吧。……这首歌的歌词，是在非常渴望自己喜欢的人，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1033_017kth", "source_sha256": "3c95b7b050d8b708c059266a888d611fcad2be11abadb55c2ae659fb83c31b9a", "ja": "その相手を、私たちが好きなものに置き換えてみると、\n理解しやすくなるのかなって……。", "zh": "要是把那个对象换成我们喜欢的东西，应该会更容易理解吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1034_027say", "source_sha256": "80c6b31e49e35a4897c0fdc6213b448b89ae11c3b89da3534967b483061ff8d7", "ja": "そうなんです！　恋愛以外の好きな気持ちも、\n対象が違うだけで、気持ちのあり方は同じかなって。", "zh": "就是这样！对恋爱以外事物的喜欢，只是对象不同，喜欢的心情本身应该是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1035_029umi", "source_sha256": "6d367fc037d57a1aa1ac2619dc5b149679099be5c6d26d6fffdfa40e5be62856", "ja": "ううっ……さよちん、私は？\n好きなものいっぱいあって、よくわかんないよー！", "zh": "呜呜……纱代子，那我呢？\n喜欢的东西太多了，我完全搞不懂啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1036_027say", "source_sha256": "f4b3bd6e2952523279b0c83debd351f7dcf4e0631bbdaeae430c85d4be4a25e8", "ja": "海美なら……あ、バレエはどう？", "zh": "说到海美……啊，芭蕾怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1037_029umi", "source_sha256": "ba2740418be5bb18456cfb44824d52872e9af55a6aaad127a794d706e1ef16fe", "ja": "バレエ……バレエ……ああっ、そういうことかー！\nさよちん、私、なんかわかったかも！？", "zh": "芭蕾……芭蕾……啊！原来是这么回事——！\n纱代亲，我好像明白了什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1038_028ari", "source_sha256": "fe265d67ab77e27cd07a2f126d6d5d9206462533a18ab2a4e0589eb66259cc4b", "ja": "う、海美ちゃん？　バレエがどうかしたんですか？", "zh": "呃、海美？芭蕾怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1039_029umi", "source_sha256": "de8ee41d1f7775ad2da0e011f5e1a7160bf0f5d2556018ac2c120c0742c5b803", "ja": "うん！　あのね、バレエって、言葉を使わないから。\n体全体で表現するんだよ！", "zh": "嗯！那个啊，芭蕾不使用语言，\n而是用整个身体来表达！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1040_033sih", "source_sha256": "2d1e3fa74bddb5d24908eea150fa284a8a3ec240086aded5e56d06279da27084", "ja": "体全体で表現する……？", "zh": "用整个身体来表达……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1041_029umi", "source_sha256": "e58aca07927b1e1af8360106754d98fbf7258f27fc0ea9aa8d8105903cfe5db8", "ja": "バレエは、台詞がないんだ！\nだからその分、動きでその時の感情を表現するの。", "zh": "芭蕾是没有台词的！\n所以才要通过动作来表达当时的感情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1042_029umi", "source_sha256": "ce2e3aa067da544006db88281aad379037e6af0db0d554564ad09c77bb8996e3", "ja": "だからね、私たちの曲の歌詞も、\nもしかしたらそういうことなのかもーって！", "zh": "所以啊，我们的歌曲歌词，说不定也是类似的感觉——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1043_017kth", "source_sha256": "b8d2a4f9913310b22d919dc4fc606dd7fac274950694b2094419079b299371ec", "ja": "紗代子が言ったのは、多分そういうことじゃないんだ\nろうけど……でも、答えには近いかもしれないね。", "zh": "纱代子说的应该不是这个意思……不过，也许确实离答案不远呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1044_027say", "source_sha256": "267e8b9fe8270dea145cbd1d5e5ec6c58800b96d7afb01f51bba146c8e223746", "ja": "それなら私たちも、言葉じゃなく体を使って、\n表現する練習をしてみるのはどうかな？", "zh": "那样的话，我们也试着不用语言，而是用身体来表达，练习一下怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1045_017kth", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1046_029umi", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1047_028ari", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1048_033sih", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1049_027say", "source_sha256": "2d7426a9d6042b455518b3a517db2cd3276a30231a7d6911d86b050f2b59b342", "ja": "よしっ、さっそくやってみよう！\nさあみんな、好きって気持ちを込めて……いくよ！", "zh": "好，立刻来试试吧！\n大家，倾注喜欢的感情……要上咯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_03_1050_p", "source_sha256": "d306595900f8a906ce818aa809bcb271cc972f1da6dd81b4e80bd6e5dc9f4d55", "ja": "（なんだかにぎやかだな……一体、どんなレッスンを\nしているんだろう。後で聞いてみよう……）", "zh": "（总觉得很热闹啊……到底在上什么样的课呢？待会儿去问问吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
